The Hong Kong-[Z]huh[ai]-Macau[ Bridge]. Photo: hzmb.hk.
According to the[ HK]JA, the only acceptable[ reason] for any public authorities to issue late-night announcements is if it is an emergency which would cause public inconvenience if not immediately announced. Since the delay mentioned in the press release was not such an emergency, and issuing the statment close to midnight was unnecessary, the Association said.
